      "message": "This seems fine, but as discussed offline there are other functions that also impact getting the GPUs to work: onImageInfo() and onNewSurface() for starters.\n\nSkCanvas inheritance is pretty brittle, and the more I think about it, the more I think we should have an SkProxyDevice that wraps an SkBaseDevice (and a matching SkProxySurface). Then SkTestCanvas would be replaced by a regular SkCanvas initialized with an SkTestDevice (extending SkProxyDevice).\n\nAll of the bespoke, client-specific, hacky things we expose at the canvas level that aren\u0027t necessarily virtual get mapped back to a much more typical virtual interface at the device-level. In particular, I am thinking of how SkCanvasPriv::TopLevelSurfaceDrawContext is used in GMs. A proxy device approach would handle this pretty trivially, a proxy canvas less so.",
